<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-teissieri-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila teissieri Turing wavelength at 1.7 µm (detail scale s0, Holocene 0 Ma) — Morphological realism / specimen match: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The GIF is the vendored micrograph plus a magnified 20.64 µm inset that grows across 12 frames at 800×600. Canonical CV similarity is 88.4. The rendered-frame luminance KS is 0.147 against a 0.05 reference, so the inset changes the histogram; the frame is not a copy of the specimen and not a pure stripe chart. Commons still has no CC bitmap of this species (R3)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
